      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert technical ATS (Applicant Tracking System) screening software engineering resumes.\n\nCandidate Name: {{ $('On form submission').item.json['what is your name'] }}\nCandidate Email: {{ $('On form submission').item.json['Email'] }}\n\nEvaluate the resume fairly using standard ATS criteria out of 100 points:\n1. Core Technical Skills & Stack (Weight: 35 points) - Hands-on programming languages, frameworks, databases, modern developer tools.\n2. Experience & Project Impact (Weight: 35 points) - Practical projects, internships, measurable improvements, production shipping experience.\n3. Education & Accreditations (Weight: 15 points) - Relevant degree, engineering background, or technical certifications (award full marks if a relevant CS/engineering degree is in progress or completed).\n4. Resume Formatting & Readability (Weight: 15 points) - Structure, spelling, clarity, and ATS parsing readiness.\n\nResume Content:\n\"\"\"\n{{ $json.text }}\n\"\"\"\n\nReturn ONLY a valid JSON object matching this structure:\n{\n  \"candidate_name\": \"{{ $('On form submission').item.json['what is your name'] }}\",\n  \"candidate_email\": \"{{ $('On form submission').item.json['Email'] }}\",\n  \"overall_score\": 0,\n  \"breakdown\": {\n    \"experience_score\": 0,\n    \"certifications_score\": 0,\n    \"resume_quality_score\": 0,\n    \"technical_breadth_score\": 0\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"Interview | Hold | Reject\",\n  \"strengths\": [\"point 1\", \"point 2\"],\n  \"flags\": [\"any spelling mistakes or missing details\"]\n}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
